{
  "$comment": [
    "The palette fixture (T9.1, LLD §13.7).",
    "",
    "What the command palette shows: every action's id, label, key and CLI command,",
    "in palette order. This file is maintained by hand and is one of the three",
    "things `tools/repo-checks/test/action-parity.test.ts` compares — the other two",
    "being `@svatah/screens`'s registry and the CLI's own command table. A check",
    "that generated this from the registry would compare the registry with itself,",
    "so renaming an action here without renaming it there (or the other way round)",
    "is exactly what has to fail.",
    "",
    "Regenerate it deliberately, never automatically:",
    "  node -e \"import('./packages/screens/dist/index.js').then(m => console.log(JSON.stringify(m.ACTIONS.map(a => ({id:a.id,label:a.label,group:a.group,screen:a.screen,...(a.key?{key:a.key}:{}),...(a.cli?{cli:a.cli}:{})})), null, 2)))\"",
    "and read the diff before committing it."
  ],
